{"game": "space-marine-2", "language": "english", "appid": 2183900, "month": "2024-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1733011200, "end_date": 1733615999, "month_true_total": 6615, "quota": 20, "returned": 20, "pulled_at": "2026-09-11 02:21:09 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "182199484", "author": {"steamid": "76561198247774950", "personaname": "ArmoredxPanda", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198247774950/", "num_games_owned": 197, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1250, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 227, "playtime_at_review": 942, "last_played": 1788800424, "avatar": "0ae942f968b49ee573497835cb941ddc293bc93b"}, "language": "english", "review": "FOR THE EMPEROR OF MANKIND!", "timestamp_created": 1733615874, "timestamp_updated": 1733615874, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182199319", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043489516", "personaname": "Xionwalker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043489516/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 622, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 553, "last_played": 1733619466, "avatar": "62f75e4239356fda12382cacb110673233c0ed2a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Can't give this game a positive review for the state it's in. There are so many issues that should've been fixed prior release. I almost refunded the game when I bought it because I thought it was broken already. No, the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ cutscenes are just broken. There's an entire mission that soft locks for 10 minutes that was supposed to be fixed ages ago. \n\nSome of the combat feels really good. Some of it feels god awful. The rest is meh. Enemy AI is pretty dumb too. \n\nA lot of the weapons are worthless too. Pretty much only used the knife up until I got the hammer, which breaks the game. \n\nSorry, but I disagree with those that reccommend. \n\nThe good stuff however, is pretty nice. I enjoyed the game and it's got a ready made story that the devs only have to read and not really invent. The AI squad work really well together. Been a while since I felt like followers were doing something. Let alone being useful. Once you figure out the controls that aren't explained, it does feel pretty good to play overall. Just fix the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ that should've already been. \n", "timestamp_created": 1733615725, "timestamp_updated": 1733615725, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1733628794, "developer_response": "Hello, Brother Xionwalker!\n\nOn behalf of the Emperor, I thank you for the valuable feedback you're providing. We're listening to our battle brothers comments, and we would love to provide the best experience for all players, we can assure you that our brothers are working to improve the game, adding more missions and difficulties to make it more challenging and fun for everyone.\n\nWe will take your feedback into account and continue working to bring improvements to the game. Rest assured that there are new things coming to the game in future updates, as we want everyone to be able to enjoy the best experience.\n\nEmperor protects!", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182198472", "author": {"steamid": "76561198795925898", "personaname": "Ric : Hocus Pocus Has My Focus", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/realdiscoric/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 1016, "playti